WEBVTT

00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:15.625
<i>Towa and Setsuna.</i>

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:20.625
<i>Between us half-demon twins,</i>
<i>two different worlds exist at the same time.</i>

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:23.292
<i>Human and demon.</i>

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:25.500
<i>Feudal era and present day.</i>

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.250
<i>Peacefulness and war.</i>

00:00:27.458 --> 00:00:29.000
<i>Joy and sorrow.</i>

00:00:29.292 --> 00:00:30.417
<i>Dreams and reality.</i>

00:00:30.917 --> 00:00:32.500
<i>One moment and eternity.</i>

00:00:32.792 --> 00:00:35.292
<i>And finally, love and hate.</i>

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.292
<i>A Feudal Fairytale,</i>
<i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon.</i>

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:43.500
<i>We'll keep moving forward</i>
<i>through the hurdles of destiny!</i>

00:03:07.458 --> 00:03:09.792
"The Gold and Silver Rainbow Pearls"

00:03:18.333 --> 00:03:19.000
Hup.

00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:21.167
HALF-DEMON GIRL – TOWA HIGURASHI
I think it was around here,

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:24.250
HALF-DEMON GIRL – TOWA HIGURASHI
the village where Mr. Jyubei said demons were rampaging.

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:27.625
MOROHA     SETSUNA
And you're sure we can trust the source of that information?

00:03:27.625 --> 00:03:30.792
Master Jyubei is as good as his word!

00:03:30.792 --> 00:03:33.458
Here's some Rock Paper Scissor
gummies as a reward.

00:03:36.208 --> 00:03:38.375
All right, let's get going.

00:03:38.375 --> 00:03:39.667
You're right.

00:03:42.417 --> 00:03:44.000
Hey, don't leave me behind!

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:47.000
Something smells like it's burning.

00:03:47.000 --> 00:03:48.750
Where's that smell coming from?

00:03:49.667 --> 00:03:51.333
Look at that.

00:03:52.292 --> 00:03:54.167
That cow is dead.

00:03:54.167 --> 00:03:55.708
It's been roasted whole.

00:03:55.708 --> 00:03:57.375
Did lightning strike it or something?

00:03:58.625 --> 00:04:01.708
It sure looks tasty though,
that poor thing.

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:03.167
Hey, you three!

00:04:03.542 --> 00:04:06.042
If you stand there, you might get hit.

00:04:06.042 --> 00:04:10.042
That cow was a victim of a fight
between demon siblings.

00:04:10.042 --> 00:04:14.167
A demon sibling fight?
So that's what this is all about, huh?

00:04:14.542 --> 00:04:15.833
<i>Siblings?</i>

00:04:16.708 --> 00:04:19.375
Yeah, their names are Kinka and Ginka.

00:04:19.375 --> 00:04:23.333
Every day they fight, and the villages here
are in a shambles from it.

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:33.208
Dear, they're coming again!

00:04:33.583 --> 00:04:34.833
Run for it!

00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:36.708
They're coming?

00:04:36.708 --> 00:04:38.375
Is it those siblings?

00:04:38.542 --> 00:04:41.583
If they're coming to us,
then that's perfect for us.

00:04:42.042 --> 00:04:44.250
That bounty will be ours.

00:04:58.417 --> 00:04:59.833
YOUNGER KA DEMON BROTHER – GINKA
Damn you, Kinka!

00:04:59.833 --> 00:05:02.708
Today is the day
I will finally pulverize your head!

00:05:02.708 --> 00:05:04.000
OLDER KA DEMON BROTHER – KINKA
Shut up, Ginka!

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:07.250
And I'll burn yours
straight through to your skull!

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:08.667
Eat this!

00:05:13.833 --> 00:05:15.208
That was dangerous.

00:05:19.417 --> 00:05:21.458
<i>Siblings? They have the same face.</i>

00:05:23.583 --> 00:05:24.542
Enough already.

00:05:24.792 --> 00:05:25.792
Who are you?

00:05:25.792 --> 00:05:27.792
You dare stop our battle?

00:05:28.208 --> 00:05:30.875
Why are you fighting?
You're siblings, aren't you?

00:05:31.083 --> 00:05:32.125
Silence!

00:05:32.125 --> 00:05:34.875
We do not wish to live as siblings.

00:05:34.875 --> 00:05:35.958
Kinka.

00:05:36.208 --> 00:05:39.250
Just hearing your voice
makes me want to hurl.

00:05:39.625 --> 00:05:44.667
Ginka, I don't want to look at your face
for one second longer.

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:53.417
If you hate each other so much,
why are you stuck together?

00:05:54.625 --> 00:05:57.625
We only part when one of us dies.

00:05:57.958 --> 00:06:01.625
Originally, this body was supposed
to become one of ours.

00:06:01.917 --> 00:06:05.333
Our kind is born with
two heads for one body.

00:06:05.333 --> 00:06:13.333
The stronger consumes the weaker,
and evolves into one powerful demon.

00:06:14.083 --> 00:06:18.917
It is eat or be eaten! However,
we have only managed to injure each other.

00:06:19.167 --> 00:06:24.667
We've never been able to kill the other,
so our battle has dragged on until now.

00:06:24.958 --> 00:06:25.833
You're wide open!

00:06:28.625 --> 00:06:31.708
Looks like it's not a matter
of getting along or not.

00:06:31.833 --> 00:06:33.167
What should we do about them?

00:06:33.583 --> 00:06:36.667
Mr. Jyubei did give us this job after all.

00:06:36.792 --> 00:06:39.792
Why not just slay them
and collect the bounty?

00:06:43.917 --> 00:06:44.708
What?

00:06:46.208 --> 00:06:48.500
Kinka, look at that!

00:06:50.667 --> 00:06:54.958
Are those not the Rainbow Pearls,
the fabled treasure that is said to increase

00:06:54.958 --> 00:06:56.667
our Ka Demon Tribe's demon powers?

00:06:57.042 --> 00:07:02.625
Indeed. Why don't we call a temporary truce,
and acquire those Rainbow Pearls?

00:07:11.292 --> 00:07:14.667
What the hell? They ran away.

00:07:14.667 --> 00:07:16.542
There goes my chance to cash in...

00:07:16.542 --> 00:07:19.208
Hey, you girls over there.

00:07:19.875 --> 00:07:24.875
You saved us. I didn't think
you'd chase those demons away.

00:07:24.875 --> 00:07:28.583
We can't do much, but please,
allow us to thank you in some way.

00:07:28.833 --> 00:07:29.625
Uh, no that's—

00:07:29.625 --> 00:07:32.750
Those guys were no trouble at all!

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:37.583
Okay, let's go. I'm starving
from all that demon slaying.

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:40.083
Thank you for the meal.

00:07:40.333 --> 00:07:41.750
Phew, I'm stuffed!

00:07:43.917 --> 00:07:46.833
Hey, Moroha. You're being rude.

00:07:46.833 --> 00:07:49.875
That's all right,
I'm glad you enjoyed the meal.

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:51.750
Geez.

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.083
What's wrong, Setsuna?

00:08:03.083 --> 00:08:06.333
Still, those brothers
were pretty hopeless, huh?

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:08.417
And here we've got sisters

00:08:08.417 --> 00:08:10.458
– What's happened to you two?
– who get along pretty well.

00:08:12.083 --> 00:08:13.958
What the heck are you doing?

00:08:15.958 --> 00:08:16.792
Whoa, hey!

00:08:17.125 --> 00:08:18.458
Let's take this outside.

00:08:18.542 --> 00:08:19.958
You're so bothersome.

00:08:22.542 --> 00:08:24.917
Hey, what's gotten into you two?

00:08:27.292 --> 00:08:30.125
Geez, both of you, enough already!

00:08:41.542 --> 00:08:43.958
<i>Why? My body is acting on its own.</i>

00:08:44.125 --> 00:08:47.500
<i>What should I do?</i>
<i>I'll end up hurting Setsuna.</i>

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.000
Hey! Stop it!

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:54.125
You two are being controlled
by those fighting demon siblings.

00:08:54.375 --> 00:08:58.917
<i>So that's what's happening.</i>
<i>No wonder my body's not listening to me.</i>

00:08:59.292 --> 00:09:01.333
<i>Then, I'll use demon slayer medicine...</i>

00:09:04.917 --> 00:09:06.667
<i>Damn it, my body won't do as I wish.</i>

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:08.667
Come on, stop it.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.875
Is that demon slayer poison?

00:09:32.042 --> 00:09:34.375
However, we were able to achieve our goal.

00:09:34.542 --> 00:09:37.083
Yes, let's return for now.

00:09:44.875 --> 00:09:48.625
Oh good! They ran away. Setsuna!

00:09:49.167 --> 00:09:52.375
I knew you and I were
siblings connected by blood.

00:09:52.708 --> 00:09:56.333
Don't misunderstand. It's thanks
to the demon slayer medicine.

00:09:56.792 --> 00:10:00.875
A-Anyway, we need to take back
the Rainbow Pearls they stole from you.

00:10:01.250 --> 00:10:04.208
You're right.
Takechiyo, are you here?

00:10:05.542 --> 00:10:08.375
You called? I'm right here.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:12.250
I'll give you chocolate gummies later,
so help us chase them down.

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.250
You got it! That's a promise.

00:10:18.375 --> 00:10:19.667
Okay, let's go.

00:10:20.875 --> 00:10:22.750
Sorry, give me a second.

00:10:25.750 --> 00:10:27.583
Okay, thanks for waiting.

00:10:27.583 --> 00:10:28.667
Wait, they're gone?

00:10:29.792 --> 00:10:32.667
Hey, wait for me!

00:10:32.917 --> 00:10:35.625
Don't leave me behind, damn it!

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:38.000
Well, there they go.

00:11:02.958 --> 00:11:05.875
Our Ka Demon Tribe's leader, Lady Joka.

00:11:06.083 --> 00:11:07.167
Lady Joka.

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:09.292
We have acquired the Rainbow Pearls,

00:11:09.292 --> 00:11:13.875
the fabled treasure said to
double our demon powers.

00:11:14.083 --> 00:11:15.958
If you would give us praise for our efforts.

00:11:16.625 --> 00:11:19.083
LEADER OF THE KA DEMONS – JOKA
I applaud you for stealing those.

00:11:19.083 --> 00:11:22.583
You've returned to me at last.

00:11:23.292 --> 00:11:27.125
I can finally get my revenge
on Sesshomaru.

00:11:29.792 --> 00:11:32.750
Our Ka Demon Tribe's leader, Lady Joka.

00:11:32.917 --> 00:11:34.083
Lady Joka.

00:11:34.083 --> 00:11:36.125
We have acquired the Rainbow Pearls,

00:11:36.167 --> 00:11:40.708
the fabled treasure said to
double our demon powers.

00:11:40.958 --> 00:11:42.750
If you would give us praise for our efforts.

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:49.167
I applaud you for stealing those.
You've returned to me at last.

00:11:49.917 --> 00:11:53.792
I can finally get my revenge
on Sesshomaru.

00:11:55.250 --> 00:11:57.167
In order to do that...

00:11:57.333 --> 00:12:02.833
I will take in your demon powers
into my body.

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:09.292
Ginka!

00:12:10.292 --> 00:12:12.083
Lady Joka, what are you...

00:12:18.875 --> 00:12:19.875
This is...

00:12:23.125 --> 00:12:23.792
What?

00:12:24.417 --> 00:12:30.250
Did you think I was supporting
your growth out of simple kindness?

00:12:32.542 --> 00:12:36.042
I was waiting for your powers
to reach their potential

00:12:36.042 --> 00:12:39.250
so you can offer your bodies to me.

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:43.542
You will now become a part of me,
demon power and all!

00:12:48.458 --> 00:12:50.250
G-Ginka.

00:12:55.542 --> 00:12:57.667
K-Kinka...

00:12:57.875 --> 00:13:02.833
<i>Ginka, your flesh is to become </i>
<i>a part of me and no other!</i>

00:13:02.958 --> 00:13:06.417
<i>She may be the leader of </i>
<i>the Ka Demon Tribe,</i>

00:13:06.417 --> 00:13:09.083
<i>but I will not allow your flesh</i>
<i>to be eaten by her!</i>

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:10.292
Ginka!

00:13:10.583 --> 00:13:13.875
Kinka, my brother!

00:13:14.375 --> 00:13:18.000
My brother! Grab my hand!

00:13:20.375 --> 00:13:22.875
– You'll be dealt with later!
– Brother!

00:13:30.875 --> 00:13:34.750
Wait for me, dammit...

00:13:35.833 --> 00:13:41.292
I can't believe them!
Those dummies. I'll get them later!

00:13:46.625 --> 00:13:47.667
What the hell...

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:48.583
...is that?

00:13:48.583 --> 00:13:51.542
Whatever it is, it's gigantic!

00:13:55.083 --> 00:13:57.292
Ginka!

00:13:58.417 --> 00:14:02.292
<i>This is exactly like the time </i>
<i>I was trying to save Setsuna</i>

00:14:02.292 --> 00:14:04.458
<i>in that forest fire.</i>

00:14:11.542 --> 00:14:13.708
Ginka, my brother!

00:14:17.875 --> 00:14:19.458
What... is happening?

00:14:20.542 --> 00:14:22.792
<i>– It'll be okay. Come on</i>!<i>
– I feel like I've </i>also

00:14:22.792 --> 00:14:26.167
<i>experienced what Kinka and </i>
<i>Ginka are going through.</i>

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:27.792
<i>But...</i>

00:14:27.792 --> 00:14:29.583
<i>Sis!</i>

00:14:29.583 --> 00:14:33.292
<i>Who was the one trying to </i>
<i>rescue me from that fire?</i>

00:14:35.083 --> 00:14:37.833
<i>Are these my memories?</i>

00:14:38.667 --> 00:14:41.292
<i>Who was that person?</i>

00:14:41.583 --> 00:14:43.500
<i>Why can't I remember?</i>

00:14:47.833 --> 00:14:49.667
Ginka!

00:14:50.000 --> 00:14:51.792
Kinka!

00:15:01.833 --> 00:15:03.833
<i>Look out!</i>

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:13.667
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:15:17.375 --> 00:15:19.167
Ginka!

00:15:22.292 --> 00:15:25.042
<i>Setsuna!</i>

00:15:27.042 --> 00:15:30.167
<i>The one who called my name </i>
<i>back then was...</i>

00:15:33.958 --> 00:15:36.375
Kinka!

00:15:36.875 --> 00:15:39.375
Ginka!

00:15:44.375 --> 00:15:46.083
K-Kinka?

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:52.500
Hey! I'll be watching you from here,
so work hard, okay?

00:15:54.875 --> 00:15:55.542
Kinka!

00:15:56.500 --> 00:15:57.667
Are you okay?

00:15:58.000 --> 00:15:59.542
You're...

00:16:00.083 --> 00:16:05.042
Please... lend us your strength.
My little brother is...

00:16:05.583 --> 00:16:06.667
Kinka.

00:16:09.667 --> 00:16:14.750
My side hurts from laughing.
Is your little brother that precious to you?

00:16:15.375 --> 00:16:16.417
Stop it!

00:16:16.542 --> 00:16:20.667
Why do you want to stop me?
It's your fate for one of you to die.

00:16:20.667 --> 00:16:25.667
You even tried to kill him yourself.
Such foolish siblings.

00:16:25.917 --> 00:16:29.292
And you seek aid from the very one
from whom you stole the Rainbow Pearls.

00:16:29.375 --> 00:16:31.458
You're an embarrassment to the clan!

00:16:32.917 --> 00:16:36.833
Hey you! You just say whatever
the hell you want to say, don't you?

00:16:37.625 --> 00:16:42.167
Let's save Ginka. I can't stand it
when people speak badly about siblings.

00:16:43.875 --> 00:16:46.042
But I have one condition.

00:16:46.042 --> 00:16:49.458
If I save him, you have to return
the Rainbow Pearls to us.

00:16:49.458 --> 00:16:52.750
Understood.
I know some sacrifices must be made.

00:16:52.792 --> 00:16:53.583
Wait.

00:16:54.542 --> 00:16:55.458
I'll go.

00:16:55.792 --> 00:16:56.958
Setsuna?

00:16:57.542 --> 00:16:58.750
I'll assist you.

00:16:58.750 --> 00:16:59.875
Thank you.

00:17:06.458 --> 00:17:11.333
<i>Setsuna, you're trying to understand</i>
<i>those siblings' feelings, aren't you?</i>

00:17:17.833 --> 00:17:19.833
What the hell are you doing?

00:17:19.833 --> 00:17:21.250
Look at your naginata.

00:17:22.292 --> 00:17:23.167
This is...

00:17:23.833 --> 00:17:26.125
My flames will be effective against Joka.

00:17:26.125 --> 00:17:29.167
With that naginata,
you should be able to defeat her.

00:17:29.417 --> 00:17:33.292
How dare you! I'll skewer your limbs!

00:17:40.917 --> 00:17:42.167
Ginka!

00:17:42.417 --> 00:17:44.000
Dear brother!

00:17:44.167 --> 00:17:46.167
You're in my way.

00:18:03.333 --> 00:18:05.625
Cyclone Burst!

00:18:15.667 --> 00:18:17.292
Ginka!

00:18:19.958 --> 00:18:20.792
Are you all right?

00:18:21.542 --> 00:18:24.458
B-Brother...

00:18:26.208 --> 00:18:30.708
The Rainbow Pearls are mine!

00:18:42.875 --> 00:18:46.583
You shielded your brother? How foolish!

00:18:53.208 --> 00:18:55.000
Scourge of...

00:18:58.417 --> 00:19:01.500
You blasted little girls!

00:19:02.417 --> 00:19:04.250
...Swallows!

00:19:26.125 --> 00:19:27.292
Did she get her?

00:19:39.583 --> 00:19:40.625
I'm sorry.

00:19:41.625 --> 00:19:44.417
I couldn't save your younger brother.

00:19:45.083 --> 00:19:51.625
He did say that we only part
when one of us dies.

00:19:52.125 --> 00:19:57.042
But I think, ever since we were born,
we already knew.

00:19:58.417 --> 00:20:01.083
That when one of us dies...

00:20:01.417 --> 00:20:03.333
...so would the other.

00:20:03.458 --> 00:20:08.625
That is the fate of us siblings
who are connected by blood.

00:20:09.583 --> 00:20:14.667
Ginka, you were the reason
I was able to keep living.

00:20:15.167 --> 00:20:22.000
Even though we hated each other,
we were each other's reason to live.

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:54.708
We got our Rainbow Pearls back.
We're going home.

00:20:54.708 --> 00:20:55.833
Setsuna.

00:20:56.833 --> 00:21:00.875
Setsuna. Could it be that you
remembered something?

00:21:05.333 --> 00:21:07.292
I finally caught up.

00:21:10.333 --> 00:21:11.875
Geez!

00:21:11.875 --> 00:21:17.167
The both of you are so horrible,
leaving me behind like that!

00:21:20.292 --> 00:21:22.750
Hey, where are those demons?

00:21:22.917 --> 00:21:25.042
It's that mountain of ash.

00:21:26.250 --> 00:21:27.917
I knew it.

00:21:27.917 --> 00:21:31.583
We can't collect our bounty
if they're all burnt up, dammit!

00:21:36.917 --> 00:21:38.750
Moroha, what are you doing?

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:43.458
If I could at least get some of
these ashes as proof...

00:21:50.417 --> 00:21:54.583
Hey, wait for me!

00:22:06.667 --> 00:22:10.958
<i>Setsuna, could your memories be...</i>

00:23:43.833 --> 00:23:45.208
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW
Let go of me, Chiyo!

00:23:45.208 --> 00:23:47.958
I'm going to avenge Ma and Pa!

00:23:47.958 --> 00:23:52.333
There's a dreadful pond that devours any
person, beast, or bird that comes near.

00:23:52.333 --> 00:23:56.458
We set out to slay the demon and meet
the siblings Hikomaru and Chiyo.

00:23:56.500 --> 00:23:58.667
That's the one I saw yesterday.

00:23:58.708 --> 00:24:02.042
I'll send you to the afterlife
with my Kurikaramaru!

00:24:02.042 --> 00:24:05.000
You annoying little girls!

00:24:05.042 --> 00:24:08.000
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon</i>:
"Curse of the Man-Eating Pond"

00:24:08.000 --> 00:24:23.979
How dare you endanger
the residents of this pond!
